## 3. Turnkey Program Formats & Workplace Integration
Our corporate offerings require zero setup or equipment burden on your facilities team:

1. **Midday Desk Reset & Posture Alignment (30–45 mins):** Accessible, non-sweat movement targeting ergonomic fatigue, neck/shoulder strain, and seated tension.
2. **Mindfulness & Mental Resilience Breathwork (30 mins):** Practical cognitive de-escalation and nervous system down-regulation tools applicable during stressful workdays.
3. **End-of-Week Restorative Flow (45–60 mins):** Full-body renewal to conclude the week, promote physical recovery, and build team community.
4. **Hybrid / Remote Delivery:** High-definition multi-camera live streaming accessible to distributed and work-from-home team members.

